  "content": "\n\n<p>此整合包内容繁杂，但易于上手。包含海量枪械、更逼真的僵尸AI、汽车、坦克和飞机，旨在打造类似丧尸末日的游戏体验。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/zombies-cars-and-tech-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19.2 版本</a></strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>特色功能：</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br>探索广阔的城市</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aShgPBr.png\" alt=\"city\" width=\"1126\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>制造传奇武器与装甲</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YUKT691.png\" alt=\"factory\" width=\"1519\" height=\"855\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>抵御僵尸进攻，保卫你的基地</p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GzlAZ9N.png\" alt=\"GUNNNN\" width=\"1126\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>驾驶各类载具</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2fAlV6z.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>击败众多新的小BOSS与新变异生物</p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oXQmqQB.png\" alt=\"defend\" width=\"1126\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>我们所有的&nbsp;</strong><strong style=\"font-weight:bold\">整合包均由 Kinetic&nbsp;Server Hosting 赞助！</strong><strong>查看<strong>&nbsp;他们的一键整合包安装服务</strong></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d300\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ffnCEvY.png\"></strong></strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>👉<strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/UyKwhyHEcc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>！&nbsp;</strong><strong>社区服务器正在建设中</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#00f\"><strong><em><span style=\"color:#0ff\">常见问题 (FAQ)</span>&nbsp;</em></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>问：如何生成城市？&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>答：在创建世界时，选择“更多世界选项”，并勾选“城市”。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>问：你们会制作支持最新版本的整合包吗？&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>答：会的！如果你想加入我们，欢迎加入 Discord！&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">每周致敬：感谢 bl4ckm4mb4sTV 带来的欢乐：</span>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FKuDI14WXis?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
